        "word_count": 472,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "Denmark has accused Russian intelligence services of plotting to assassinate a Ukrainian-American near Copenhagen, saying they had \"planned\" and \"initiated\" the attempt. Denmark's security and intelligence agency (PET) said it had stopped individuals who were intending to kill the person, named by Danish media as rapper Kyivstoner, at a concert in September.",
